{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Ch71gaJQ77DdypPtfpYkH","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I made one change to what you asked for. The email doesn't say \"we cut picking errors in half.\" It says one named type of customer cut theirs by more than half.\n\n- **Why:** Only your pet-supply customer halved its errors (4.1 to 1.9, a 54% drop). Of the other two customers who track error rates, one improved by about 21% (2.8 to 2.2) and one hasn't shared numbers. \"We cut errors in half\" suggests that's the typical result. A VP of ops who loses $600K a year to this problem will probably ask \"is that typical?\" on the first call. At that point the true answer would make the email look inflated. Your real result is strong enough without stretching it.\n- **IT director:** I said only what you know for sure: it sits on top of the WMS and doesn't replace it. I didn't write \"no IT involvement\" or \"no integration,\" because he'd test that claim first. If setup really needs little or nothing from his team, say so in one plain sentence. That's the strongest thing you could add.\n- **Price:** I left it out. Five sites would cost $75K a year against her $600K+ in returns, and that comparison works well on a first call. In a cold email it gives her an easy reason to say no before she's interested.\n- **Fill in:** the placeholders in brackets. Use the real magazine name if you have it, because it shows you actually read the interview.\n\n<final_document>\nSubject: Your $600K wrong-item problem\n\nHi Dana,\n\nLast spring you told [Magazine] that returns from wrong-item shipments cost you \"north of $600,000 a year.\" That's the exact problem we work on.\n\nWorkers scan each item with a phone camera, and our software flags a wrong item before the box closes. In its first five months, one of our customers, a pet-supply distributor with three warehouses, went from 4.1 mis-picks per 1,000 order lines to 1.9.\n\nIt sits on top of your existing WMS and doesn't replace it. Setup takes about three weeks.\n\nWould a 20-minute call be worth it to see whether that could work at your five sites?\n\n[Your name]\nCo-founder, [Company]\n[Phone]\n</final_document>"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":5498,"cache_read_input_tokens":3853,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":5498},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"c2777986-dd3c-4abf-8521-8193a92d0b3f","uuid":"c98a6633-bc36-4507-b221-38fda6aafd0d","timestamp":"2026-11-16T17:37:06.327Z","request_id":"req_011Ch71ga51y6z9KLoVtMjfs"}
